Package: rNotify
Title: Resilient Multi-Channel Notifications and Progress Tracking for R Jobs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Keith", "Hurley", email = "keith.l.hurley@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a unified, resilient multi-channel notification and process-monitoring
    framework for R scripts and long-running computational jobs. Features multiplexed dispatch
    to mobile push (Pushover, ntfy.sh), email, desktop notifications with chimes, generic
    webhooks, and Cheap Yellow Display (CYD) ESP32 hardware modules. Includes single-stage and
    nested loop progress tracking with composite global ETAs, multi-level throttling (time
    intervals and percentage milestones), zero-impact fault isolation, and a detached
    background sentinel (dead man's switch) that notifies channels if the R session aborts
    or crashes unexpectedly.
